Package: fwp-desktop
Version: 0.0.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jeremy Toth <jtoth@spendmend.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-pip, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, ffmpeg, ca-certificates
Homepage: https://github.com/R005ter/fwp
Description: Fireworks Planner desktop downloader
 Mini desktop app for adding YouTube videos to your Fireworks Planner
 library at fireworks-planner.onrender.com. Downloads run on your
 residential IP (Render's datacenter IPs are blocked by YouTube), then
 the resulting MP4 is uploaded to the remote server.
